  abilityName: Soul-Record Unravel
  abilityDesc: 18 combo Water attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    4 combo Water attack on single foe (or probable 5% damage of foes' max HP), boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec and critical rate for 4 turns, boosts Water elemental damage for
    4 turns, boosts spark damage for 4 turns & fills OD gauge
